DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260720
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260721
SUMMARY:Deadline: OUTsider Fest 2027: Dreaming US into Being (call for quee
 r time-based art)
DESCRIPTION:OUTsider\, the transdisciplinary queer arts festival in Austin\
 , invites LGBTQ+ artists working in any time-based form (film\, performanc
 e\, sound\, multimedia) to propose work for its 2027 edition themed Dreami
 ng US into Being. The call prioritizes marginalized artists\, explicitly i
 ncluding by migratory status and nationality. Deadline 20 July 2026.\n\nOr
 ganisation: OUTsider\nLocation: Austin\, Texas\, United States (festival F
 ebruary 2027). International-friendly\; prioritizes marginalized artists i
 ncluding by migratory status and nationality.\nAward: Festival presentatio
 n slot for time-based work (film\, performance\, sound\, multimedia). Arti
 st compensation and travel support not stated. No fee stated.\nDuration: F
 estival February 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.outsiderfest.org/2027-theme?ut
